Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(ux):=20TTY-aware=20human=20output=20for=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?issue=20writes=20(create/claim/close/=E2=80=A6)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Resolves UX4a (60e196f4) without breaking the scripting contract: writes render a
concise '✓ Created <id>' confirmation at an interactive terminal, but keep the
machine-parseable JSON envelope when piped/scripted/non-interactive. The CLI entry
(bin/forge.js) passes isInteractive from process.stdout.isTTY; the library defaults to
non-interactive so scripts and tests get JSON by default. Reads stay human-first always.
Regenerated the D20 bd-call-site artifact (line shift). Verified: piped create → JSON,
interactive → confirmation; 65 issue/render tests + 55 release-readiness tests green.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
